  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Community Resilience and Recovery Support to returning Internally Displaced Persons (IDP) in Federally Administered Tribal Areas (FATA), Pakistan.  This joint  seeks to improve people&#x2019;s livelihoods, provide better access to basic services, strengthen social cohesion and increase FATA Secretariat&apos;s capacity.</narrative>
  </description>
